date: 2026-07-29T23:41:12-04:00
---

War is two creatures melded into one. From the waist down it is a normal, if overly-muscled, humanoid. However, from their midsection sprouts two separate torsos. The two upper bodies are locked in an eternal struggle, each in the middle of driving a sword through the heart of the other. Their heads have long been removed in the fight, but this does not appear to damper their fervor.
